-- Traffic Domain TR-B2c: replace coarse 4-point corridor chords with
-- street-centerline-traced seed geometry. These coordinates are traced from the
-- checked-in Flint OSM highway fixture used by the public atlas. The live feed
-- path can later replace these rows with MDOT/OSM edge-id geometry without a
-- frontend contract change.

